{"ref":"BDB, קְלָלָה","hw":"קְלָלָה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְלָלָה</span></big><sub>33</sub>  <strong>n.f. curse</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:12\" href=\"/Genesis.27.12\">Gn 27:12</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִלְלַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:57\" href=\"/Judges.9.57\">Ju 9:57</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִלְלָֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:13\" href=\"/Genesis.27.13\">Gn 27:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קִלְלָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.12\">2 S 16:12</a> (van d. H. Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">קללתי</span>, so We Dr Löhr); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְלָלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.15\">Dt 28:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:45\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.45\">45</a>;—<em>curse</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:12\" href=\"/Genesis.27.12\">Gn 27:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:13\" href=\"/Genesis.27.13\">13</a> (J); often opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרָכָה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.26\">Dt 11:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.6\">23:6</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.2\">Ne 13:2</a>, + 8 times Dt., <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:34\" href=\"/Joshua.8.34\">Jos 8:34</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:57\" href=\"/Judges.9.57\">Ju 9:57</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:17\" href=\"/Psalms.109.17\">ψ 109:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:18\" href=\"/Psalms.109.18\">18</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.14\">Pr 27:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קִלְלַת חִנָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.2\">Pr 26:2</a> <em>a groundless curse</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.12\">2 S 16:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קְלָלָה נִמְרֶצֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.8\">1 K 2:8</a> <em>a grievous curse;</em> = a formula of cursing <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.22\">Je 29:22</a>; = <em>object of curse</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קִלְלַת אֱלֹהִים תָּלוּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.23\">Dt 21:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמָּה וּקְלָלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.19\">2 K 22:19</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 24:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.24.9\">Je 24:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.18\">25:18</a> + 6 times Je, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:13\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.13\">Zc 8:13</a>.","next":"BDB, קַלַּי²","prev":"BDB, קָלָל"}